      "message": "test(turning): pin the Facing window door - inverted refused, level passes\n\nThe #1409 Facing arm of depth_sane (exact `t >= b`) was unpinned: making\nit always true left every suite green. Two pins over the MCP door\n(add_operation / edit_operation -> heights_gate):\n\n- an inverted window (edit 47 / 48, and create on 46 stock under a 48\n  part) refuses with \"must cut downward\";\n- a level window (48 / 48) passes the door, and a top 1e-9 below the\n  plane refuses - the arm carries no tolerance.\n\nRefs #1409\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
